hadiths[92]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1753","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab us jamara ki rami kartey jo Mina ki masjid ke nazdeek hai to saat (7) kankariyon se rami kartey aur har kankari ke sath takbeer ( Allahu-akbar ( kehtey, phir aagey badhtey aur qibla rukh khadey ho kar donon hath utha kar duaein kartey they, yahan Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahut der tak khadey rahtey they phir jamara saaniya ( wustaa (ke paas aatey yahan bhi saat (7) kankariyon se rami kartey aur har kankari ke sath ( Allahu-akbar ( kehtey, phir baain taraf naley ke qareeb utar jatey aur wahan bhi qibla rukh khadey hotey aur hathon ko utha kar dua kartey rahtey, phir jamara Aqba ke paas aatey aur yahan bhi saat (7) kankariyon se rami kartey aur har kankari ke sath (Allaahu-akbar) kehtey, iske baad wapas ho jatey yahan aap dua ke liye thahartey nahi they. Zohri ne kaha ke maine Salim se suna wo bhi isi tarah apne walid (ibne-Umar (rz)) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadis bayan kartey they aur ye ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) khud bhi isi tarah kya kartey they."
"1754","maine khud apne hathon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke, jab aap ne ehram baandhna chaha, khushbu lagai thi is tarah kholtey waqt bhi jab aap ne tawaafe-ziyaara se pahley ehram kholnaa chaha tha (aap ne hath phaila kar khushbu lagaaney ki kaifiyat bataaii)."
"1755","logon ko iska hukm tha ke unka aakhiri waqt Baitullah ke sath ho (yani tawaaf wadaa' karein) albatta haaiza se ye maaf ho gaya tha."
"1756","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuhar, Asr, maghrib aur isha padhi, phir thodi der Muhassab mein so rahe, iske baad Sawar ho kar Baitullah tashrif le gaey aur wahan tawaafe-ziyaara Amr-bin-Haris ke sath kya, is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Leis ne ki hai, unse Khalid ne bayan kya, unse Saeed ne, unse Qatada ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql kya hai."
"1757","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Safiya-bint-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) (hijjatul-wadaa ke mauqe par) haaiza ho gain to maine iska zikr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir to ye hamein rokengii, logon ne kaha ke unhon-ne tawaafe-ifaaza kar liya hai, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir koi fikr nahi."
"1758","Madina ke logon ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aik aurat ke mutaalliq puchha ke jo tawaaf karne ke baad haaiza ho gaee thin, aap ne unhein bataya ke (unhein thaharney ki zarurat nahi balke) chali jaaein. lekin poochhney walon ne kaha ham aisa nahi karengey ke aap ki baat par amal to karein aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ki baat chhod dein, Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke jab tum Madina pahunch jao to ye masla wahan (badey sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se) poochhna . chunanche jab ye log Madina aaey to poochha, jin akaabir se puchha gaya tha unmein Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) bhi thin aur unhon-ne (unke jawab mein wahi ( Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis bayan ki. us hadis ko Khalid aur Qatada ne bhi Ikrima se riwayat kya hai."
"1759","Madeena ke logon ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aik aurat ke mutaalliq puchha ke jo tawaaf karne ke baad haaiza ho gaee thin, aap ne unhein bataya ke (unhein thaharney ki zarurat nahi balke) chali jaaein. lekin poochhney walon ne kaha ham aisa nahi karengey ke aap ki baat par amal to karein aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ki baat chhod dein, Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke jab tum Madina pahunch jao to ye masla wahan (badey sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se) poochhna . chunanche jab ye log Madina aaey to poochha, jin akaabir se puchha gaya tha unmein Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) bhi thin aur unhon-ne (unke jawab mein wahi ( Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis bayan ki. us hadis ko Khalid aur Qatada ne bhi Ikrima se riwayat kya hai."
"1760","aurat ko uski ijazat hai ke agar wo tawaafe-ifaaza ( tawaaf ziyaarat ( kar chuki ho aur phir ( tawaaf wadaa' se pahley) haiz aa jaey to (apne ghar ( wapas chali jaey."
"1761","us aurat ke liye waapsii nahi. iske baad maine unse suna aap farmatey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aurton ko uski ijazat di hai."
"1762","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath nikley, hamari niyat Haj ke siwa aur kuchh na thi. phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka) pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Baitullah ka tawaaf aur Safa aur Marwa ki saee ki, lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ehram nahi khola kyonke aap ke sath qurbani thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon ne aur doosrey ashaab ne bhi tawaaf kya aur jinke sath qurbani nahi thin unhon-ne (is tawaaf w saee ke baad) ehram khol diya lekin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) haaiza ho gaee thin, sab ne apne Haj ke tamam manaasik ada kar liye they, phir jab lailatul-hasba yani rawaangii ki raat aai to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke tamam sathi Haj aur Umra donon karke ja rahe hain sirf mein Umra se mahroom hun, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha jab ham aaey they, to tum ( haiz ki wjah se) Baitullah ka tawaaf nahi kar saki thiin? maine kaha ke nahi, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir apne bhai ke sath taneem chali ja aur wahan se Umre ka ehram baandh (aur Umra kar) ham tumhara falan jagah intizar karengey, chunanche main apne bhai (Abdur-Rehmaan (rz)) ke sath taneem gaee aur wahan se ehram baandhaa. isi tarah Safiya-bint-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) bhi haaiza ho gaee thin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein (az-raah muhabbat) farmaya ( عقرى حلقى ), Mina to, to hamein rok legii, kya tu ney qurbani ke din tawaafe-ziyaarat nahi kya tha? wo boliin ke kya tha, is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir koi harj nahi, chali chalo. mein jab aap tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka ke oopri ilaqe par chadh rahe they aur main utar rahi thi ya ye kaha ke main chadh rahi thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utar rahe they. Musaddad ki riwayat mein (rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kehney par) haan ke bajaey nahi hai, uski mutabiat (pairavi) Jarir ne Mansoor ke waaste se ''nahin'' ke zikr mein ki hai."
"1763","mujhey wo hadis bataaey jo aapko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yad ho ke unhon-ne aathwein Zil-Hijja ke din Zohar ki Namaz kahan padhi thi, unhon-ne kaha Mina mein, maine puchha aur rawaangii ke din Asr kahan padhi thi unhon-ne farmaya ke Abtah main aur tum isi tarah karo jis tarah tumharey Hakim log kartey hun. (taake fitna waaqe na ho)."
"1764","Zuhar, Asr, maghrib, isha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne padhi aur thodi der ke liye Muhassab mein so rahe, phir Baitullah ki taraf Sawar ho kar gaey aur tawaaf kya. (yahaan tawaafe-ziyaara murad hai)."
"1765","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Mina se kooch karke yahan Muhassab mein isliye utrey they taake aasani ke sath Madina ko nikal sakein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad Abtah mein utarney se thi."
"1766","Muhassab mein utarnaa Haj ki koi ibadat nahi hai, ye to sirf Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qiyam ki jagah thi."
"1767","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Makka jatey waqt zi tuwa ki donon pahaadiyon ke darmyan raat guzaartey they aur phir us pahaadii se ho kar guzartey jo Makka ke uper ki taraf hai aur jab Makka mein Haj ya Umre ka ehram baandhney aatey to apni ontni masjid ke darwaze par la kar bithatey phir hajre-Aswad ke paas aatey aur yahin se tawaaf shuru kartey, tawaaf saat (7) chakkaron mein khatm hota jiske shuru mein ramal kartey aur char mein mamool (routine) ke mutabiq chaltey, tawaaf ke baad 2 rakaat Namaz padhtey phir dera par wapas honey se pahley Safa aur Marwa ki daud kartey. jab Haj ya Umra karke Madina wapas hotey to zul-Hulaifa ke maidan mein sawari bithatey , jahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi (Makka se Madina wapas hotey huey) apni sawari bithaya kartey they."
"1768","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur umr aur ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Muhassab mein qiyam farmaya tha. Naafe se riwayat hai ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Muhassab mein Zohar aur Asr padhtey they. mera khayal hai ke unhon-ne maghrib (padhney ka bhi) zikr kya, Khalid ne bayan kya ke isha mein mujhey koi shak nahi. iske padhney ka zikr zaroor kya phir thodi der ke liye wahan so rahtey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bhi aisa hi mazkoor hai."
"1769","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) jab Madina se Makka aatey to zii-Tuwa mein raat guzaarey aur jab subah sadiq hoti to Makka mein dakhil hotey . isi tarah Makka se waapsii mein bhi zii-Tuwa se guzartey aur wahin raat guzaarey aur farmatey ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi isi tarah kartey they."
"1770","zul-Majaaz aur Ukaaz ahade-jaahiliyat ke bazar they jab Islam aaya to maano logon ne (jaahiliyat ke un bazaron mein) khareed w farokht ko bura khayal kya. is par (sura al-Baqara ki) ye aayat nazil hui ''tumhaarey liye koi harj nahi agar tum apne rab ke Fazal ki talash karo, ye Haj ke zamane ke liye tha."
"1771","Makka se rawaangii ki raat Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) haaiza thin, unhon-ne kaha ke aisa malum hota hai main un logon ke rokney ka baais bin jaaungii , phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ( عقرى حلقى ( kya tu ney qurbani ke din tawaafe-ziyaara kya tha? usne kaha ke ji haan kar liya tha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir chalo."
"1772","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (hijjatul-wadaa ( mein Madina se nikley to hamari zabanon par sirf Haj ka zikr tha. jab ham Makka pahunch gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ehram khol dene ka hukm diya ( Umra ada karney ke baad jinke sath qurbani nahi thi) rawaangii ki raat Safiya-bint-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) haaiza ho gain , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ( عقرى حلقى ( aisa malum hota ke tum hamein rokney ka baais banogii, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya qurbani ke din tum ne tawaafe-ziyaara kar liya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke haan, is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir chali chalo! (Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne mutaalliq kaha ke) maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! maine ehram nahi khola hai aap ne farmaya ke tum taneem se Umre ka ehram baandh lo (aur Umra kar lo ( chunanche Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke sath unke bhai gaey ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) farmaya ke ham raat ke aakhir mein wapas lot rahe they ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mulaqat hui, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke ham tumhara intizar falan jagah karengey."
"1773","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aik Umra ke baad doosra Umra donon ke darmyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hai aur Haj mabroor ki jazaa jannat ke siwa aur kuchh nahi hai."
"1774","Ikrima bin Khalid ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se Haj se pahley Umra karne ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha koi harj nahi, Ikrima ne kaha ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Haj karne se pahley Umra hi kya tha aur Ibrahim bin Sad ne Muhammad-bin Ishaq se bayan kya, unse Ikrima bin Khalid ne bayan kya ke maine Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha phir yahi hadis bayan ki. ham se Amr bin Ali iflaas ne bayan kya, unse abu-Aasim ne bayan kya, unhein ibne-Juraij ne khabar di, unse Ikrima bin Khalid ne bayan kya ke maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha phir yahi hadis bayan ki."
"1775","main aur Urwa-bin-Zubair masjide-Nabawi mein dakhil huey, wahan Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre ke paas baithey huey they, kuchh log masjide-Nabawi mein ishraaq ki Namaz padh rahe they. unhon-ne bayan kya ke ham ne Abdullah-bin-Umar se un logon ki us Namaz ke mutaalliq puchha to aap ne farmaya ke bidat hai, phir unse puchha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kitney Umerey kiye they? unhon-ne kaha ke chaar, aik unmein se rajab mein kya tha, lekin ham ne pasand nahi kya ke unki is baat ki tardeed karein."
"1776","ham ne Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre se unke miswak karne ki awaz suni to Urwa ne puchha aey meri maan ! aey Ummul-Momenin ! abu-Abdur-Rehman ki baat aap sun rahi hain? Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne puchha wo kya keh rahe hain? unhon-ne kaha keh rahe hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne char Umerey kiye they jin mein se aik rajab mein kya tha, unhon-ne farmaya ke Allah abu-Abdur-Rehman par raham karey ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to koi Umra aisa nahi kya jis mein wo khud maujood na rahi hon, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rajab main to kabhi Umra hi nahi kya."
"1777","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se puchha to aap ne farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rajab mein koi Umra nahi kya tha."
"1778","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kitney Umerey kiye they? to aap ne farmaya ke char , Umra Hudaibiya Zi-Qada mein jahan par mushrekeen ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko rok diya tha, phir aainda saal Zi-Qada hi mein aik Umra qaza jiske mutaalliq Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mushrekeen se suleh ki thi aur tesraa Umra Jaarana jis mauqe par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghaaliban Hunain ki ghaneemat taqseem ki thi, chotha Haj ke sath maine puchha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Haj kitney kiye? farmaya ke eik."
"1779","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke Umra ke mutaalliq puchha to aap ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Umra wahan kya jahan se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mushrekeen ne wapas kar diya tha aur doosrey saal (usii) Umra Hudaibiya (ki qaza ( ki thi aur aik Umra Zi-Qada main aur aik apne Haj ke sath kya tha."
"1780","jo Umra Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne Haj ke sath kya tha iske siwa tamam Umerey Zi-Qada hi mein kiye they. Hudaibiya ka Umra aur doosrey saal uski qaza ka Umra tha. (kyonke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Quran kya tha aur Hijjatul-wada se mutaalliq hai) aur Jaarana ka Umra jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jange-Hunain ki ghaneemat taqseem ki thi. phir aik Umra apne Haj ke sath kya tha."
"1781","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Haj se pahley Zi-Qada hi mein Umerey kiye they aur unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maah Zi-Qada mein Haj se pahley 2 Umerey kiye they."
"1782","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Ansari khatun (umme-Sanaan (rz)) se (ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne unka naam bataya tha lekin mujhey yad na raha ( puchha ke to hamarey sath Haj kyon nahi karti? wo kehney lagi ke hamarey paas aik oont tha, jis par Abu-Fulaan (yani iska khaawind) aur iska betaa Sawar ho kar Haj ke liye chal diye aur aik oont unhon-ne chhoda hai, jis se pani laya jata hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha jab Ramazan aaey to Umra kar lena kyonke Ramazan ka Umra aik Haj ke barabar hota hai ya usi jaisi koi baat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmai."
"1783","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina se nikley to Zil-Hijja ka chaand nikalney wala tha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar koi Haj ka ehram baandhna chahta hai to wo Haj ka baandh ley aur agar koi Umre ka baandhna chahta hai to wo Umre ka baandh ley. agar mere sath qurbani ka janwar na hota to main bhi Umre ka ehram baandhtaa . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke ham mein kuchh ne to Umre ka ehram baandha aur kuchh ne Haj ka ehram baandhaa. mein bhi un logon mein thi jinhoney Umre ka ehram baandha tha, lekin Arfa ka din aaya to main us waqt haaiza thi, chunanche maine uski Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se shikayat ki Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Umra chhod de aur sar khol de aur is mein kangha kar ley phir Haj ka ehram baandh lenaa. (maine aisa hi kya) jab Muhassab mein qiyam ki raat aai to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdur-Rehman ko mere sath taneem bhejaa, wahan se maine Umre ka ehram apne us Umre ke badle mein baandha (jis ko tod daala tha) ."
"1784","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko apne sath sawari par ley jayen aur taneem se unhein Umra kara laaein . Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne kahin yun kaha maine Amr-bin-Dinar se suna, kahin yun kaha maine kai baar us hadis ko Amr-bin-Dinar se suna."
"1785","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ke ashaab ne Haj ka ehram baandha tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke siwa qurbani kisi ke paas nahi thi. un hi dinon mein Ali (Raziallahu anhu) Yaman se aaey to unke sath bhi qurbani thi. unhon-ne kaha ke jis cheez ka ehram Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baandha hai mera bhi ehram wahi hai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ashaab ko (Makka mein pahunch kar) uski ijazat de di thi ke apne Haj ko Umra mein tabdeel kar dein aur Baitullah ka tawaaf aur Safa w Marwa ki saee karke baal tarashwa lein aur ehram khol dein, lekin wo log aisa na karein jinke sath qurbani ho. is par logon ne kaha ke ham Mina se Haj ke liye is tarah se jaeinge ke hamarey zakar (private part) se mani tapak rahi ho. ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo baat ab hui agar pahley se malum hoti to main apne sath qurbani ka janwar na laataa aur agar mere sath qurbani ka janwar na hoti to (Umra ada karney ke baad) main bhi ehram khol deta. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) (is Haj mein) haaiza ho gaee thin isliye unhon-ne halaanki tamam manaasik ada kiye lekin Baitullah ka tawaaf nahi kya. phir jab wo paak ho gain aur tawaaf kar liya to kaha ya Rasulullah ! sab log Haj aur Umra donon karke wapas ho rahe hain lekin main sirf Haj kar saki hon, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par Abdur-Rehman bin Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke unhein sath lekar taneem jayen aur Umra kara laaein , ye Umra Haj ke baad Zil-Hijja ke hi maheene mein hua tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab jamara Aqba ki rami kar rahe they, to Suraqa bin Malik bin Jaasham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur puchha ke ya Rasulullah ! kya ye ( Umra aur Haj ke darmyan ehram khol dena ( sirf aap hi ke liye hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi balke hamesha ke liye hai."
"1786","mujhey Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne khabar di unhon-ne kaha ke Zil-Hijja ka chaand nikalney wala tha ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina se Haj ke liye chaley Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo Umre ka ehram baandhna chahey wo Umre ka baandh ley aur jo Haj ka baandhna chahey wo Haj ka baandh ley , agar main apne sath qurbani na laataa to main bhi Umre ka hi ehram baandhtaa , chunanche bahut se logon ne Umre ka ehram baandha aur bahuton ne Haj kaa. main bhi un logon mein thi jinhoney Umre ka ehram baandha tha. magar main Makka mein dakhil honey se pahley haaiza ho gaee, Arfa ka din aa gaya aur abhi main haaiza hi thi, iska ronaa main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney rooii , Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Umra chhod de aur sar khol ley aur kangha kar ley phir Haj ka ehram baandh lenaa, chunanche maine aisa hi kya, iske baad jab Muhassab ki raat aai to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere sath Abdur-Rehman ko taneem bheja wo mujhey apni sawari par peechhey bitha kar le gaey wahan se Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne apne (chhodey huey) Umerey ke bajaey doosrey Umre ka ehram baandha is tarah Allah Taala ne unka bhi Haj aur Umra donon hi poorey kar diye na to uske liye unhein qurbani laanii padi na sadqa dena padaa aur na roza rakhna padaa."
"1787","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! log to Haj aur Umra karke wapas ho rahe hain aur maine sirf aik Haj kiya hai? is par unse kaha gaya ke phir intizar karein aur jab paak ho jayen to taneem ja kar wahan se (Umra ka ( ehram baandhein, phir ham se falan jagah aa milein aur ye ke us Umre ka sawab tumharey kharch aur mehnat ke mutabiq milega."
"1788","Haj ke mahinon aur aadaab mein ham Haj ka ehram baandh kar Madina se chaley aur maqam sarf mein padao kya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ashaab se farmaya ke jiske sath qurbani na ho aur wo chahey ke apne Haj ke ehram ko Umra mein badal de to wo aisa kar sakta hai, lekin jiske sath qurbani hai wo aisa nahi kar sakta. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ke ashaab mein se kuchh maqdoor walon ke sath qurbani thi, isliye unka ( ehram sirf ( Umre ka nahi raha, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey to main ro rahi thi, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke ro kyon rahi ho? maine kaha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ashaab se jo kuchh farmaya main sun rahi thi, ab to mera Umra reh gaya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya baat huii? maine kaha ke main Namaz nahi padh sakti (haiz ki wjah se) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke koi harj nahi, to bhi Adam ki betiyon mein se aik hai, aur jawan sab ke muqaddar mein likha hai wahi tumhara bhi muqaddar hai. ab Haj ka ehram baandh ley shayad Allah Taala tumhen Umra bhi naseeb kare. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke maine Haj ka ehram baandh liya phir jab ham (Haj se farigh ho kar aur) Mina se nikal kar Muhassab mein utrey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdur-Rehman ko bulaya aur unse kaha ke apni behan ko haram ki had se bahar ley ja ( taneem (taake wo wahan se Umre ka ehram baandh lein, phir tawaaf w saee karo ham tumhara intizar yahin karengey. ham aadhi raat ko aap ki khidmat mein pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya farigh ho gaey? maine kaha haan, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske baad apne ashaab mein kooch ka elaan kar diya. Baitullah ka tawaaf wadaa' karne waley log subah ki Namaz se pahley hi rawaana ho gaey aur Madina ki taraf chal diye."
"1789","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jaarana mein they, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik shakhs hazir hua jubba pahney huey aur is par khalooq ya zardi ka nishan tha. usne puchha mujhey apne Umre mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kis tarah karne ka hukm detey hain? is par Allah Taala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi nazil ki aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par kapda daal diya gaya, meri badi aarzoo thi ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahiy nazil ho rahi ho to main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhun. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya yahan aao Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jab wahi nazil ho rahi ho, us waqt tum Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhney ke aarzoomand ho? maine kaha haan! unhon-ne kapdey ka kinara uthaya aur maine usmein se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha aap zor-zor se kharraatey ley rahe they, mera khayal hai ke unhon-ne bayan kya ''jaisey oont ke saans ki awaz hoti hai'' phir jab wahi utarnii band hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke poochhney wala kahan hai jo Umra ke barey mein poochhta tha? apna jubba utaar de, khalooq ke asar ko dho daal aur) zafran ki) zardi saaf kar ley aur jis tarah Haj mein kartey ho isi tarah ismein bhi karo."
"1790","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) se puchha jabke abhi main nau-umr tha ke Allah Taala ka irshad ''Safaa aur Marwa donon Allah Taala ki nishaniyan hain isliye jo shakhs Baitullah ka Haj ya Umra karey uske liye unki saee karne mein koi gunah nahin'' isliye main samajhta hun ke agar koi unki saee na karey to is par koi gunah na hoga. ye sun kar Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke hargiz nahi. agar matlab ye hota jaisa ke tum bata rahe ho phir to unki saee na karne mein waqei koi harj nahi tha, lekin ye aayat to Ansar ke barey mein nazil hui hai jo manaat but ke naam ka ehram baandhtey they jo qudaid ke muqabil mein rakha hua tha wo Safa aur Marwa ki saee ko achchha nahi samajhtey they, jab Islam aaya to unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske barey mein puchha aur is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai ke ''Safaa aur Marwa donon Allah ki nishaniyan hain isliye jo shakhs Baitullah ka Haj ya Umra karey uske liye unki saee karne mein koi gunah nahin'' Sufiyan aur abu-Muawia ne Hisham se ye zyadti nikaalii hai ke jo koi Safa Marwa ka phera na karey to Allah uska Haj aur Umra pura na karega ."
"1791","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umra bhi kya aur ham ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Umra kya, chunanche jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka mein dakhil huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pahley (Baitullaah ka ( tawaaf kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ham ne bhi tawaaf kya, phir Safa aur Marwa aaey aur ham bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aaey. ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Makka walon se hifazat kar rahe they ke kahin koi kaafir teer na chala de, mere aik sathi ne ibn-abii-Aufii se puchha kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kaba mein andar dakhil huey they? unhon-ne farmaya ke nahi."
"1792","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ke mutaalliq kya kuchh farmaya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke aap ne farmaya tha '' Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ko jannat mein aik mautaa ke ghar ki bashaarat ho, jis mein na kisi qism ka shor w ghul hoga na koi takleef hogii.''"
"1793","ham ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aik aisey shakhs ke barey mein malum kya jo Umre ke liye Baitullah ka tawaaf to karta hai lekin Safa aur Marwa ki saee nahi karta, kya wo (sirf Baitullah ke tawaaf ke baad) apni biwi se ham-bistar ho sakta hai? unhon-ne iska jawab ye diya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka) tashrif laey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Baitullah ka saat (7) chakkaron ke sath tawaaf kya, phir maqaame-Ibraaheem (Alaihissalam) ke qareeb 2 rakaat Namaz padhi, iske baad Safa aur Marwa ki saat (7) martaba saee ki ''aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi tumharey liye behtreen namoona hai.''"
"1794","ham ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se bhi iske mutaalliq sawal kya to aap ne farmaya Safa aur Marwa ki saee se pahley apni biwi ke qareeb bhi na jana chahiye"
"1795","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein Batha mein hazir hua aap wahan (Haj ke liye jatey huey utrey huey they) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kya tumhara Haj hi ka irada hai? maine kaha, ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha aur ehram kis cheez ka baandha hai? maine kaha maine usi ka ehram baandha hai, jiska Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ehram baandha ho, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tu ney achchha kya, ab Baitullah ka tawaaf aur Safa aur Marwa ki saee kar ley phir ehram khol daal, chunanche maine Baitullah ka tawaaf kya aur Safa aur Marwa ki saee, phir main banu-Qais ki aik aurat ke paas aaya aur unhon-ne mere sar ki juein nikaaliin, iske baad maine Haj ka ehram baandhaa. main (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad) usi ke mutabiq logon ko masla bataya karta tha, jab umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat ka daur aaya to aap (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke hamein kitabullah par amal karna chahiye ke usmein hamein (Haj aur Umra) pura karne ka hukm hua hai aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat par amal karna chahiye ke us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ehram nahi khola tha jab tak qurbani ke janwar ki qurbani nahi ho gaee thi. lihaza qurbani ka janwar sath laney walon ke waastey aisa hi karne ka hukm hai."
"1796","Asma binte- abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghulam Abdullah ne unse bayan kya, unhon-ne Asma (Raziallahu anha) se suna tha, wo jab bhi hajoon pahaad se ho kar guzartiin to ye kehtin rahmatein nazil hon Allah ki Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par, ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath yahin qiyam kya tha, un dinon hamarey ( saman ( bahut halkey-phulkey they, sawaariyaan aur zaade-raah ki bhi kami thi, maine, meri behan Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne, Zuber aur falan-falan (Raziallahu anhu) ne Umra kya aur jab Baitullah ka tawaaf kar chukey to ( Safa aur Marwa ki saee ke baad) ham halal ho gaey, Haj ka ehram ham ne Sham ko baandha tha."
"1797","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi jang ya Haj w Umra se wapas hotey to jab bhi kisi buland jagah ka chadhaao hota to teen martaba ( Allahu-akbar ( kehtey aur ye dua padhtey لا إله إلا الله وحده لا شريك له ، Mina padhi. له الملك ، Mina padhi. وله الحمد ، Mina padhi. وهو على كل شىء قدير ، Mina padhi. آيبون تائبون عابدون ساجدون لربنا حامدون ، Mina padhi. صدق الله وعده ونصر عبده وهزم الأحزاب وحدهAllaah ke siwa koi maabood nahi wo akelaa hai uska koi Sharik nahi, mulk usi ka hai aur hamd usi ke liye hai wo har cheez par qaadir hai, ham wapas ho rahe hain, tauba kartey huey ibadat kartey huey apne rab ke huzoor sajda kartey huey aur uski hamd kartey huey, Allah ne apna wada sachcha kar dikhaya , apne bandey ki madad ki aur sarey lashkar ko tanha shikast de di. (fatah Makka ki taraf ishara hai).''"
"1798","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka tashrif laey to banu- abdul-Muttalib ke chand bachchon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka istiqbaal kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik bachchey ko (apni sawari ke) aagey bitha liya aur doosrey ko peechhey."
"1821","mere walid suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par) dushmanon ka pata lagaaney ( nikley. phir unke sathiyon ne to ehram baandh liya lekin) khud unhon-ne abhi ( nahi baandha tha ( asl mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kisi ne ye itlaa di thi ke maqam ghaiqa mein dushman aap ki taak mein hai, isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( abu-Qatada aur chand sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ko unki talash mein) rawaana kya mere walid ( abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu)) apne sathiyon ke sath they ke ye log aik doosrey ko dekh kar hansney lagey ( mere walid ne bayan kya ke) maine jo nazar uthai to dekha ke aik janglii gadhaa samney hai. main is par jhaptaa aur neze se usey thanda kar diya. maine apne sathiyon ki madad chahi thi lekin unhon-ne inkar kar diya tha, phir ham ne gosht khaayaa. ab hamein ye dar hua ke kahin (rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se) door na ho jaaein, chunanche maine aapko talash karna shuru kar diya kabhi apne ghodey tez kar deta aur kabhi aahista, aakhir raat gaey banu- ghifaar ke aik shakhs se mulaqat ho gaee. maine puchha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kahan hain? unhon-ne bataya ke jab main aap se juda hua to aap maqam Ta'hin mein they aur aap ka irada tha ke maqam Saqeeya mein pahunch kar do-pahar ka aaraam karengey. gharaz main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho gaya aur maine kaha ya Rasulullah ! aap ke ashaab aap par salam aur Allah ki rehmat bhejtey hain. unhein ye dar hai ke kahin wo bahut peechhey na reh jaaein. isliye aap thahar kar unka intizar karein, phir maine kaha ya Rasulullah! maine aik janglii gadhaa shikar kya tha aur uska kuchh bacha hua gosht ab bhi mere paas maujood hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon se khaney ke liye farmaya halanke wo sab ehram baandhey huey they."
"1822","ham suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath chaley unke sathiyon ne to ehram baandh liya tha lekin unka bayan tha ke maine ehram nahi baandha tha. hamein ghaiqa mein dushman ke maujood honey ki itlaa mili isliye ham unki talash mein (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm ke mutabiq ( nikley phir mere sathiyon ne gorkhar dekha aur aik doosrey ko dekh kar hansney lagey maine jo nazar uthai to usey dekh liya ghodey par) Sawar ho kar) is par jhaptaa aur usey zakhmi karke thanda kar diya. maine apne sathiyon se kuchh imdaad chahi lekin unhon-ne inkar kar diya phir ham sab ne usey khaya aur uske baad main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua (pahley ( hamein dar hua ke kahin ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se door na reh jayen isliye main kabhi apna ghoda tez kar deta aur kabhi aahista aakhir meri mulaqat aik banii-Ghifaar ke aadmi se aadhi raat mein hui maine puchha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kahan hain? unhon-ne bataya ke main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Ta'hin naam ke jagah mein alag hua tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka irada ye tha ke do-pahar ko maqam Saqeeya mein aaraam karengey phir jab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to maine kaha ya Rasulullah ! aap ke ashaab ne aapko salam kaha hai aur unhein dar hai ke kahin dushman aap ke aur unke darmyan haail na ho jaey isliye aap unka intizar kijiye chunanche aap ne aisa hi kya, maine ye bhi kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! maine aik gorkhar ka shikar kya aur kuchh bacha hua gosht ab bhi maujood hai is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ashaab se farmaya ke khaao halanke wo sab ehram baandhey huey they."
"1823","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina se teen manzil door maqam qaaha mein they. (doosri sanad imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne) kaha ke ham se Ali-bin-Abdullaah ne bayan kya, kaha ke ham se Sufiyan ne bayan kya kaha ham se Saaleh-bin-Kaisaan ne bayan kya, unse abu-Muhammad ne aur unse abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maqam qaaha mein they, kuchh to ham mein se ehram ki haalat mein they aur kuchh ghair mahram. maine dekha ke mere sathi aik doosrey ko kuchh dikhaa rahe hain, maine jo nazar uthai to aik gorkhar samney tha, unki murad ye thi ke unka kodaa gir gaya, (aur apne sathiyon se usey uthaney ke liye unhon-ne kahaa), lekin sathiyon ne kaha ke ham tumhari kuchh bhi madad nahi kar saktey kyonke ham mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) hain) isliye maine wo khud uthaya iske baad main us gorkhar ke nazdeek aik teeley ke peechhey se aaya aur usey shikar kya, phir main usey apne sathiyon ke paas laayaa, kuchh ne to ye kaha ke (hamein bhi) kha lena chahiye lekin kuchh ne kaha ke nahi khana chahiye phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya. aap ham se aagey they, maine aap se masla puchha to aap ne bataya ke kha lo ye halal hai. ham se Amr-bin-Dinar ne kaha ke Saaleh-bin-Kaisaan ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar us hadis aur uske ilawa ke mutaalliq poochh saktey ho aur wo hamarey paas yahan aaey they."
"1824","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( Haj ka ( irada karke nikley. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) bhi aap ke sath they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba ki aik jamat ko jis mein abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they ye hidayat de kar rastey se wapas bheja ke tum log dariya ke kinarey kinaarey ho kar jao, (aur dushman ka pata lagaao ( phir ham se aa milo. chunanche ye jamat dariya ke kinaarey-kinaarey chalii, waapsii mein sab ne ehram baandh liya tha lekin abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne abhi ehram nahi baandha tha. ye qaafila chal raha tha ke kai gorkhar dikhai diye, abu-Qatada ne un par hamla kya aur aik maada ka shikar kar liya, phir aik jagah thahar kar sab ne uska gosht khaya aur sath hi ye khayal bhi aaya ke kya ham ehram ki haalat me honey ke bawajud shikar ka gosht bhi kha saktey hain? chunanche jo kuchh gosht bacha wo ham sath laey aur jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pahunchey to kaha ya Rasulullah! ham sab log to ehram ki haalat me they lekin abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne ehram nahi baandha tha phir ham ne gorkhar dekhey aur abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne un par hamla karke aik maada ka shikar kar liya, iske baad aik jagah ham ne qiyam kya aur uska gosht khaya phir khayal aaya ke kya ham ehram ki haalat me honey ke bawajud shikar ka gosht kha bhi saktey hain? isliye jo kuchh gosht baqi bacha hai wo ham sath laey hain. aap ne puchha kya tum mein se kisi ne abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ko shikar karne ke liye kaha tha? ya kisi ne us shikar ki taraf ishara kya tha? sab ne kaha nahi. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir bacha hua gosht bhi kha lo."
"1825","jab wo Abwaa ya Wadaan mein they, to unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik gorkhar ka tohfa diya to aap ne usey wapas kar diya tha, phir jab aap ne unke chehron par narazagi ka rang dekha to aap ne farmaya waapsii ki wjah sirf ye hai ke ham ehram baandhey huey hain."
"1826","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya panch janwar aisey hain jinhein maarney mein ehram waaley ke liye koi harj nahi hai."
"1827","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ehram wala (panch janwaron ko) mar sakta hai. ( jinka zikr aagey aa raha hai)."
"1828","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke panch janwar aisey hain jinhein maarney mein koi gunah nahi kowa, cheel, choohaa, bichchhoo aur kaat khaney wala kuttaa."
"1829","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya panch janwar aisey hain jo sab ke sab moozii hain aur unhein haram mein bhi maara ja sakta hai kowa , cheel , bichho , choohaa aur kaatney wala kutta ."
"1830","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Mina ke ghaar mein they ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par sura Mursalaat nazil honii shuru hui. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski tilawat karne lagey aur main aapki zaban se usey seekhney laga, abhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tilawat khatm bhi nahi ki thi ke ham par aik sanp giraa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya usey mar dalo chunanche ham uski taraf lapkey lekin wo bhag gaya. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis tarah se tum iske shar se bach gaey wo bhi tumharey shar se bach kar chala gaya. (abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke us hadis se mera maqsad sirf ye hai ke Mina haram mein dakhil hai aur sahaba ne haram mein sanp maarney mein koi harj nahi samjha tha) ."
"1831","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhipkalii ko moozii kaha tha lekin maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye nahi suna ke aap ne usey maarney ka bhi hukm diya tha."
"1832","jab Amr bin Saeed Makka par lashkar kashii kar raha tha to unhon-ne kaha ameer ijazat de to main aik aisi hadis sunaun jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne fateh Makka ke doosrey din irshad farmai thi, us hadis Mubarak ko mere in kanon ne suna, aur mere dil ne poori tarah usey yad kar liya tha aur jab aap irshad farma rahe they, to meri aankhen aapko dekh rahi thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki hamd aur uski sana bayan ki, phir farmaya ke Makka ki hurmat Allah ne qaaim ki hai logon ne nahin! isliye kisi aisey shakhs ke liye jo Allah aur yaume-aakhirat par eman rakhta ho ye jaaiz aur halal nahi ke yahan khoon bahaaey aur koi yahan ka aik darakht bhi na kaatey lekin agar koi shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qitaal (fatah Makka ke mauqe par) se iska jawaz nikaley to us se ye keh do ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Allah ne ijazat di thi, lekin tumhen ijazat nahi hai aur mujhey bhi thodi si der ke liye ijazat mili thi phir dobara aaj uski hurmat aisi hi qaaim ho gaee jaisey pahley thi aur haan jo maujood hain wo ghayab ko (Allah ka ye paighaam) pahuncha dein, abu-Shuraih se kisi ne puchha ke phir Amr-bin-Saeed ne (ye hadis sun kar) aapko kya jawab diya tha? unhon-ne bataya ke Amr ne kaha abu-Shuraih! main ye hadis tum se bhi zyada janta hun magar haram kisi mujrim ko panah nahi deta aur na khoon karke aur na kisi jurm karke bhaagney waley ko panah deta hai. ( خربة ( se murad ( خربة بلية‏ ( hai."
"1833","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Allah Taala ne Makka ko hurmat wala banaya hai mujh se pahley bhi ye kisi ke liye halal nahi tha isliye mere baad bhi wo kisi ke liye halal nahi hoga. mere liye sirf aik din ghadi bhar halal hua tha isliye uski ghaas na ukhaadii jaey aur uske darakht na kaatey jaaein, iske shikar na bhadkaaye jayen aur na wahan ki giri hui cheez uthai jaey. haan elaan karne wala utha sakta hai. (taake asl Malik tak pahuncha de) Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! izkhir ki ijazat dijiye kyonke ye hamarey sunaaron aur hamari qabron ke liye kaam aati hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke izkhir ki ijazat hai. Khalid ne riwayat kya ke Ikrima (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne farmaya ke tum jantey ho ke shikar ko na bhadkaane se kya murad hai? iska matlab ye hai ke (agar kahin koi janwar saaye mein betha hua hai to) usey saaye se bhagaa kar khud wahan qiyam na kare."
"1834","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne fateh Makka ke din farmaya ab hijrat farz nahi rahi lekin) achi ( niyat aur jihad ab bhi baqi hai isliye jab tumhen jihad ke liye bulaya jaey to taiyaar ho jaanaa. us Shahar (Makka) ko Allah Taala ne isi din hurmat ata ki thi jis din us ne aasman aur zameen paida kiye, isliye ye Allah ki muqarrar ki hui hurmat ki wjah se mohtaram hai yahan kisi ke liye bhi mujh se pahley ladai jaaiz nahi thi aur mujhey bhi sirf aik din ghadi bhar ke liye (fatah Makka ke din ijazat mili thi) ab hamesha ye Shahar Allah ki qaaim ki hui hurmat ki wjah se qiyamat tak ke liye hurmat wala hai to iska kaantaa kaataa jaey na iske shikar haankey jayen aur us shakhs ke siwa jo elaan karne ka irada rakhta ho koi yahan ki giri hui cheez na uthaey aur na yahan ki ghaas ukhaadii jaey. Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ya Rasulullah ! izkhir (eik ghaas ( ki ijazat to dijiye kyonke yahan ye kaariigaron aur gharon ke liye zaroori hai to aapney farmaya ke izkhir ki ijazat hai."
"1835","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ehram ki haalat mein they us waqt aap ne pachhna lagwaayaa tha. phir maine unhein ye kehtey suna ke mujh se Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se Taaus ne ye hadis bayan ki thi. us se maine ye samjha ke shayad unhon-ne un donon hazraat se ye hadis suni hogi (mutakallim Amr hain aur donon hazraat se murad ata aur Taaus (Rahmatullahi-alaih) hain) ."
"1836","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jabke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ehram ki haalat mein they apne sar ke beech mein maqam Lahiy-jamal mein pachhna lagwaayaa tha."
"1837","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab Memuna (Raziallahu anha) se nikah kya to aap ehram ki haalat mein they."
"1838","aik shakhs ne khadey ho kar puchha ya Rasulullah ! haalat ehram mein hamein kon se kapdey pahnney ki ijazat detey hain? to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke na qamees pahno na paajaamey , na amaamey aur na barans . agar kisi ke jootey na hon to mozon ko takhnon ke nichey se kaat kar pahan ley. isi tarah koi aisa libaas na pahno jis mein zafran ya waras laga ho. ehram ki haalat mein auratein munh par Naqaab na daalein aur dastaaney bhi na pahnein . Leis ke sath is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Musa-bin-Aqba aur Ismail bin Ibraaheem-bin-Aqba aur Juweriya aur ibne- Ishaq ne Naqaab aur dastaanon ke zikr ke silsiley mein ki hai. Ubaidullah (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne (aur waras nahin) ka lafz bayan kya wo kehtey they ke ehram ki haalat mein aurat munh par na Naqaab daley aur na dastaaney istemal karey aur Imam Malik ne Naafe se bayan kya aur unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya ke ehram ki haalat mein aurat Naqaab na daley aur Lais-bin-abii-Saleem ne Malik ki tarah riwayat ki hai."
"1839","aik mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) shakhs ke oont ne Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par uski gardan ( gira kar) tod di aur usey jaan se mar diya, us shakhs ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney laya gaya to aap ne farmaya ke unhein ghusl aur kafan de-do lekin unka sar na dhako aur na khushbu lagaao kyonke (qiyamat mein) ye labbaik kehtey huey uthega."
"1840","Abdullah-bin-Abbas aur miswar-bin-Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ka maqaame-Abwaa mein (eik mas'ale par) ikhtilaf hua. Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey Abu-Ayub (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan (mas'ala poochhney ke liye) bhejaa, main jab unki khidmat mein pahuncha to wo kunein ki 2 lakdiyon ke beech ghusl kar rahe they, aik kapdey se unhon-ne parda kar rakha tha maine pahunch kar salam kya to unhon-ne malum farmaya ke kon ho? maine kaha ke main Abdullaah-bin-Hunain hun, aap (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein mujhey Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bheja hai ye malum karne ke liye ke ehram ki haalat main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sar Mubarak kis tarah dhotey they. ye sun kar unhon-ne kapdey par (jis se parda tha) hath rakh kar usey nichey kya. ab aap ka sar dikhai de raha tha, jo shakhs unke badan par pani daal raha tha, us se unhon-ne pani dalney ke liye kaha, us ne unke sar par pani daalaa, phir unhon-ne apne sar ko donon hath se hilaayaa aur donon hath aagey le gaey aur phir peechhey laey farmaya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko (ehraam ki haalat mein) isi tarah kartey dekha tha."
"1841","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Arafaat mein khutba detey suna tha ke jiske paas ehram mein jootey na hon wo mozey pahan ley aur jiske paas tehband na ho wo paa-jaama pahan ley."
"1842","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya ke ehram ki haalat mein kon se kapdey pahan sakta hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qamees, amaamaa, paa-jaama aur barans (kin top ya barish koot) na pahney aur na koi aisa kapda pahney jis mein zafran ya waras lagi ho aur agar jootiyaan na hon to mozey pahan ley, albatta is tarah kaat ley ke takhnon se nichey ho jaaein."
"1843","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham ko maidaane-Arafaat mein waz (nasihat) sunaya, usmein aap ne farmaya ke agar kisi ko ehram ke liye tehband na miley to wo paa-jaama pahan ley aur agar kisi ko jootey na milein to wo mozey pahan ley."
"1844","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zi-Qada mein Umra kya to Makka walon ne aapko Makka mein dakhil honey se rok diya, phir unse us shart par suleh hui ke hathiyar niyaam mein daal kar Makka mein dakhil hongey."
"1845","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Madina walon ke liye zul-Hulaifa ko meeqaat banaya, Najad walon ke liye Qarnul-Manaazil ko aur Yaman walon ke liye Yalamlam ko. ye meeqaat un mulkon ke baashindon ke liye hai aur doosrey un tamam logon ke liye bhi jawan mulkon se ho kar Makka aaein aur Haj aur Umre ka bhi irada rakhtey hon, lekin jo log un hudood ke andar hon to unki meeqaat wahi jagah hai jahan se wo apna safar shuru karein yahan tak ke Makka walon ki meeqaat Makka hi hai."
"1846","fateh Makka ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Makka mein dakhil huey to aap ke sar par khod tha. jis waqt aap ne utara to aik shakhs ne khabar di ke ibne- khatal Kaba ke pardon se latak raha hai aap ne farmaya ke usey qatl kar do."
"1847","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik shakhs jo jubba pahney huey tha hazir hua aur is par zardi ya isi tarah ki kisi khushbu ka nishan tha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) mujh se kaha kartey they kya tum chahtey ho ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi nazil honey lagey to tum Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh sako? us waqt aap par wahi nazil hui phir wo haalat jati rahi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis tarah apne Haj mein kartey ho isi tarah Umra mein bhi karo."
"1848","aik shakhs ne doosrey shakhs ke hath mein daant se kaataa tha, doosrey ne jo apna hath kheenchaa to uska daant ukhad gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iska koi badla nahi dilwaayaa."
"1849","maidaane-Arafaat mein aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath thehra hua tha ke apni ontni se gir padaa aur us ontni ne uski gardan tod daalii, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke pani aur berii ke patton se usey ghusl do aur ehram hi ke 2 kapdon ka kafan do lekin khushbu na lagaanaa na iska sar chhipaanaa kyonke Allah Taala qiyamat mein usey labbaik kehtey huey uthaaega."
"1850","aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Arafaat mein thehra hua tha ke apni ontni se gir padaa aur usne uski gardan tod di, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey pani aur berii se ghusl de kar do kapdon (ehraam walon hi mein) kafnaa do, lekin khushbu na lagaanaa, na sar chhipaanaa aur na Hanoot lagaanaa kyonke Allah Taala qiyamat mein usey labbaik pukaartey huey uthaaega."
"1851","aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maidaane-Arafaat mein tha ke uske oont ne gira kar uski gardan tod di. wo shakhs ehram ki haalat mein tha aur mar gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye hidayat di ke usey pani aur berii ka ghusl aur (ehraam ke) 2 kapdon ka kafan diya jaey albatta usko khushbu na lagaao na uska sar chhipaao kyonke qiyamat ke din wo labbaik kehta hua uthega."
"1852","qabila Juhaina ki aik aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur kaha ke meri walida ne Haj ki mannat maana thi lekin wo Haj na kar sakiin aur unka intiqal ho gaya to kya main unki taraf se Haj kar sakti hoon? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, unki taraf se to Haj kar. kya tumhari maan par qarz hota to tum usey ada na kartiin? Allah Taala ka qarza to uska sabse zyada mustahiq hai ke usey pura kya jaey. to Allah Taala ka qarz ada karna bahut zaroori hai."
"1853","ham se abu-Aasim ne ibne-Juraij se bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha unse ibne-Shahab ne, unse Sulaiman-bin-Yasar ne, unse Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Fazal-bin-Ayaaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke aik khatun .) hadis number 1854 dekhein ("
"1854","Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par qabila Khash'am ki aik aurat aai aur kaha ya Rasulullah ! Allah Taala ki taraf se fareeza Haj jo iske bandon par hai usne mere boodhey bap ko pa liya hai lekin unmein itni sakat nahi ke wo sawari par bhi baith sakein to kya main unki taraf se Haj kar loon to unka Haj ada ho jaaeyga? aap ne farmaya ke haan."
"1855","Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par peechhey baithey huey they. itney mein qabila Khash'am ki aik aurat aai. Fazal (Raziallahu anhu) usko dekhney lagey aur wo Fazal (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekhney lagi isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fazal ka chehra dusri taraf pherney lagey, us aurat ne kaha ke Allah ke fareeze ( Haj ( ne mere boodhey walid ko us haalat mein pa liya hai ke wo sawari par baith bhi nahi saktey to kya main unki taraf se Haj kar sakti hon, aap ne farmaya ke haan. ye Hijjatul-wada ka waqia hai."
"1856","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey Muzdalfa ki raat Mina mein saman ke sath aagey bhej diya tha."
"1857","main apni aik gadhi par Sawar ho kar (Minaa mein aaya (us waqt mein jawaanii ke qareeb tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Mina mein khadey Namaz padha rahe they. main pehli saf ke aik hissey ke aagey se ho kar guzra phir sawari se nichey utar aaya aur usey charney ke liye chhod diya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey logon ke sath saf mein Sharik ho gaya, Yunus ne ibne-Shahab ke waaste se bayan kya ke ye Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par Mina ka waqia hai."
"1858","mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Haj karaya gaya tha. main us waqt saat (7) saal ka tha."
"1859","Saaib (Raziallahu anhu) ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke saman ke sath (yani baal bachchon mein) Haj karaya gaya tha."
"1860","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne aakhiri Haj ke mauqe par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon ko Haj ki ijazat di thi aur unke sath Usman-bin-Affan aur Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ko bheja tha."
"1861","maine puchha ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! ham bhi kyon na Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jihad aur jangon mein jaya karein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum logon ke liye sabse umda aur sabse munasib jihad Haj hai, wo Haj jo maqbool ho. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) kehti thin ke jab se maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye irshad sun liya hai Haj ko main kabhi chhodney wali nahi hun."
"1862","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi aurat apne mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) rishtedar ke baghair safar na karey aur koi shakhs kisi aurat ke paas us waqt tak na jaey jab tak wahan koi mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) maujood na ho. aik shakhs ne puchha ke ya Rasulullah! main falan lashkar mein jihad ke liye nikalnaa chahta hun, lekin meri biwi ka irada Haj ka hai? to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke to apni biwi ke sath Haj ko jaa."
"1863","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hijjatul-wada se wapas huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne umme-Sanaan ansariya aurat (Raziallahu anhu) se malum farmaya ke to Haj karne nahi gaii? unhon-ne kaha ke falan ke bap yani mere khawind ke paas 2 oont pani pilaaney ke they aik par to khud Haj ko chaley gaey aur doosra hamari zameen sairaab karta hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke Ramazan mein Umra karna mere sath Haj karne ke barabar hai, is riwayat ko ibne-Juraij ne Ata se suna, kaha unhon-ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, aur Ubaidullah ne Abdul-Karim se riwayat kya, unse Ata ne unse Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"1864","maine Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se suna jinhoney Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath baara jihad kiye they. wo kehtey they ke maine char baatein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni thin ya ye ke wo ye char baatein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql kartey aur kehtey they ke ye baatein mujhey intihai pasand hain ye ke koi aurat 2 din ka safar us waqt tak na karey jab tak uske sath iska shauhar ya koi mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) na ho, na eidul-fitr aur eidul-Azha ke rozey rakhey jayen na Asr ki Namaz ke baad ghurub honey ke pahley aur na subah ki Namaz ke baad suraj nikalney se pahley koi Namaz padhi jaey aur na teen masaajid ke siwa kisi ke liye kajaawey baandhey jayen masjide-Haraam , meri masjid aur masjide-Aqsaa."
"1865","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik boodhey shakhs ko dekha jo apne 2 beton ka sahara liye chal raha hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha un sahib ka kya haal hai? logon ne bataya ke unhon-ne Kaba ko paidal chalney ki mannat maana hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala us se be-niyaaz hai ke ye apne ko takleef mein daalein phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein sawar honey ka hukm diya."
"1866","Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya meri behan ne mannat maana thi ke Baitullah tak wo paidal jaaeingii, phir unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke tum iske mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bhi poochh lo chunanche maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo paidal chalein aur sawar bhi ho jaaein. Yazeed ne kaha ke abul-Khair hamesha Aqba (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath rahtey they."